OL,3,GNEWSARapist jailed after secretly
OL,4,Arecorded cafe confession
OL,5,
OL,6,FA rapist who was caught after his
OL,7,Fvictim secretly recorded his confession
OL,8,Fin a cafe has been jailed for five
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FDavid Smyth admitted having sex with
OL,12,Fthe woman while she slept at a property
OL,13,Fin Falkirk.
OL,15,FA court heard Smyth later told his
OL,16,Fvictim, who had been on a night out
OL,17,Fwith friends: "You couldn't say no in
OL,18,Fthe state you were in."
OL,20,FThe 36-year-old was found guilty of
OL,21,Fraping the woman in 2019 following a
OL,22,Ftrial at the High Court in Stirling.
